{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"elf_war_bear","model_identifier":"elf_war_bear","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# elf_war_bear\n\nElf war bear (A3), tamed bear (B7 body) in elven war gear, 1.3 m at the hump (46 u, saddle to 50 u).\n\nThe B7 brown bear with a leaf-plate chest piece, a leaf-plate chanfron down the face, silver-grey cloth with leaf-cut edges over the flanks, and a woven saddle with pommel and cantle on the shoulders. Same rig and clips as `bear`; slot_rider sits on the saddle at the shoulders.\n\n- Cubes: 28 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.5..11.5, y 0.0..50.5, z -42.0..25.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 22 x 50 x 64 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0; with rider add 16 x 50 x 14 above the saddle\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop | breathing, looking around |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.45 | loop |  |\n| `charge` | 0.414 | loop | bounding charge, head low (loop) |\n| `swipe` | 1 | once | key 0.46 s: right forepaw sweeps through the target (arc in front) |\n| `rear_roar` | 2.6 | once | stands up (upright at 1.0 s), roar 1.0-1.6 s, back down by 2.6 s |\n| `sniff` | 2.4 | loop | nose to the ground (loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back from the front |\n| `death` | 1.4 | hold | rolls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 0.9 s (4-beat)\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.00 m/s), cycle 0.45 s (bounding gallop)\n- `charge`: 204.4 u/s (5.75 m/s), head low\n\n## Key times\n\n- `swipe`: key 0.46 s: right forepaw sweeps through the target (arc in front)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 47.5, -3)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `saddle` (group under body, visible): woven saddle; hide it for the riderless elf_tamed_bear\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `elf_war_bear_elf_tamed_bear.png`: fights on foot without a rider: the flank cloth is repainted as a dark leather harness; hide the `saddle` group (the texture alone cannot remove geometry)\n- `elf_war_bear_cub.png`: young texture (half scale)\n\n## Notes\n\n- slot_rider (0, 47.5, -3) on body: put the rider's hips here (elf_bear_rider sits astride with the legs spread round the bear's shoulders).\n"},"description":"# elf_war_bear\n\nElf war bear (A3), tamed bear (B7 body) in elven war gear, 1.3 m at the hump (46 u, saddle to 50 u).\n\nThe B7 brown bear with a leaf-plate chest piece, a leaf-plate chanfron down the face, silver-grey cloth with leaf-cut edges over the flanks, and a woven saddle with pommel and cantle on the shoulders. Same rig and clips as `bear`; slot_rider sits on the saddle at the shoulders.\n\n- Cubes: 28 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.5..11.5, y 0.0..50.5, z -42.0..25.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 22 x 50 x 64 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0; with rider add 16 x 50 x 14 above the saddle\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop | breathing, looking around |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.45 | loop |  |\n| `charge` | 0.414 | loop | bounding charge, head low (loop) |\n| `swipe` | 1 | once | key 0.46 s: right forepaw sweeps through the target (arc in front) |\n| `rear_roar` | 2.6 | once | stands up (upright at 1.0 s), roar 1.0-1.6 s, back down by 2.6 s |\n| `sniff` | 2.4 | loop | nose to the ground (loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back from the front |\n| `death` | 1.4 | hold | rolls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 0.9 s (4-beat)\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.00 m/s), cycle 0.45 s (bounding gallop)\n- `charge`: 204.4 u/s (5.75 m/s), head low\n\n## Key times\n\n- `swipe`: key 0.46 s: right forepaw sweeps through the target (arc in front)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 47.5, -3)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `saddle` (group under body, visible): woven saddle; hide it for the riderless elf_tamed_bear\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `elf_war_bear_elf_tamed_bear.png`: fights on foot without a rider: the flank cloth is repainted as a dark leather harness; hide the `saddle` group (the texture alone cannot remove geometry)\n- `elf_war_bear_cub.png`: young texture (half scale)\n\n## Notes\n\n- slot_rider (0, 47.5, -3) on body: put the rider's hips here (elf_bear_rider sits astride with the legs spread round the bear's shoulders).\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"torso","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.5,21.0,-18.0],"to":[10.5,39.5,13.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,34.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[31,51,52.0,69.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[78,31,109.0,49.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[52,51,73.0,69.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,51,31.0,69.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,21.0,31.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[21,0,42.0,31.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d20cd5b6-8e73-54ba-8994-408f487a5cc0"},{"name":"rump","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.0,22.0,11.0],"to":[10.0,38.5,22.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,34.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[95,51,115.0,67.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[20,70,31.0,86.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,70,20.0,86.5],"texture":0},"west"